---
description: Service Layer Implementation Guidelines
globs: "**/*.service.ts"
alwaysApply: true
---
- Services handle business logic only, not database operations
{{#if isMongoose}}- Call repository methods for data access, never directly access the database{{/if}}
{{#if isPrisma}}- Use PrismaService for data access, inject it properly{{/if}}
- Services should be stateless and focused on specific business operations
- Handle domain-specific errors with appropriate business exceptions
- Validate input parameters and throw appropriate errors
{{#if isGraphQL}}- Return data in format expected by GraphQL resolvers{{/if}}
{{#if isRest}}- Return data in format expected by REST controllers{{/if}}
@service-template.ts
